    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59462" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κουρι-άω</span></b> , of hair, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>need clipping</i>
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πώγων εἰς ὑπερβολὴν κουριῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Gall.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of persons,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν χρῷ κ.</span>
			<i>need</i> close <i>clipping</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνθρωπος ἀεὶ -ιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Lex.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>wear rough, untrimmed hair</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				7.48
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τὸ γένειον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					3.55
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				1.19
			</span></i> (interpol.).</div>
